+/**
+ * GstGLConfigCaveat:
+ * @GST_GL_CONFIG_CAVEAT_NONE: none
+ * @GST_GL_CONFIG_CAVEAT_SLOW: slow
+ * @GST_GL_CONFIG_CAVEAT_NON_CONFORMANT: non-conformant
