+
+/***** helper macros *****/
+/* GstPad */
+
+/**
+ * GST_PAD_NAME:
+ * @pad: a #GstPad
+ *
+ * Get name of the given pad.
+ * No locking is performed in this function, use gst_pad_get_name() instead.
