@@ -0,0 +1,329 @@
+/* GStreamer Navigation
+ * Copyright (C) 2003 Ronald Bultje <rbultje@ronald.bitfreak.net>
+ * Copyright (C) 2003 David A. Schleef <ds@schleef.org>
+ *
+ * navigation.h: navigation interface design
