@@ -0,0 +1,310 @@
+/* GStreamer Video Overlay Composition
+ * Copyright (C) 2011 Intel Corporation
+ * Copyright (C) 2011 Collabora Ltd.
+ * Copyright (C) 2011 Tim-Philipp Müller <tim centricular net>
+ *
